  "raw_text": "he burrito. Agent: That makes perfect sense. So, sogginess and a cold temperature are definitely deal-breakers. Is there one more thing that would make your... User: Yes. Agent: Okay, what would be that one more thing? User: If it was just messy and just overly just leaky out everywhere, I think that would be that would upset me. Agent: I understand. A messy or leaky burrito would certainly be frustrating. Now, if your favorite Chipotle burrito was unavailable, what would you order instead, including the chain and the specific item? User: The Chipotle asada bowl. Agent: And why is the Chipotle asada bowl the closest replacement for your favorite burrito? User: It's pretty much like the burrito, except for it's like in a bowl. I can still customize it like I would a burrito. So I'm not giving up a ton of, you know, stuff to... I'm not compromising a ton just to get the asada bowl instead of the burrito. Agent: That's a clear explanation of why it's a good alternative. Can you name two",
